{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-20f6144a04ec","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-20f6144a04ec","name":"菠菜炒鸡蛋","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E8%8F%A0%E8%8F%9C%E7%82%92%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B/%E8%8F%A0%E8%8F%9C%E7%82%92%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"5bd71d3b27ed568014bcfd054db4995dc5440d80","details":{"introduction":"菠菜炒鸡蛋是一道清淡爽口的家常快手菜，菠菜软嫩、鸡蛋鲜香，属于南北皆宜的大众风味。菠菜富含铁、叶酸和维生素，鸡蛋提供优质蛋白与卵磷脂，搭配食用有助于补血养气、增强体质。整道菜操作简单，非常适合烹饪新手，从备料到出锅大约只需 15 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 菠菜\n- 鸡蛋\n- 食用油\n- 食用盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"按照 1 人的份量：\n\n- 菠菜 350g\n- 鸡蛋 2 个\n- 食用油 15ml\n- 食用盐 5g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 菠菜去根，洗净，放在篮子里，焯水\n2. 将鸡蛋打入碗中，搅匀\n3. 热锅，加入 10ml 油\n4. 油热后，倒入鸡蛋液，中火翻炒 15 秒，先煎成蛋饼，然后再用锅铲切成小块\n5. 关火，将鸡蛋块 盛到盘子中，不要洗锅\n6. 重新开火，倒入 5ml 油，油热后，放入菠菜，大火 翻炒 15 秒后，倒入鸡蛋块，翻炒均匀\n7. 加入 5g 盐、100ml 饮用水，大火 翻炒 10 秒\n8. 关火，盛盘"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：菠菜400g、净全鸡蛋液150g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g；整份约450g。不弃蛋液，菠菜不先焯水，采用标准直接炒制版本。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":97.577778,"protein_g":6.742222,"carbohydrate_g":3.466667,"fat_g":6.85},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients","version":"92a5511163b62320","fdc_ids":[168462,171287,171411,173468]},"profile_id":"family-20f6144a04ec-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-20f6144a04ec","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-20f6144a04ec","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-20f6144a04ec-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"spinach","grams":400},{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"92a5511163b62320","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-20f6144a04ec-v1.6c1f0df97db9dc2d.json","bytes":20543,"sha256":"6c1f0df97db9dc2d0df7e5239899336241a9bd681b54ca7c5cca230074211311"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-20f6144a04ec-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-20f6144a04ec","recipe_blob_sha":"5bd71d3b27ed568014bcfd054db4995dc5440d80","version":"1","data_version":"92a5511163b62320","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":450,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品450g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：菠菜400g、净全鸡蛋液150g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g；整份约450g。不弃蛋液，菠菜不先焯水，采用标准直接炒制版本。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-20f6144a04ec","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-20f6144a04ec-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"spinach","grams":400},{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":97.577778,"protein_g":6.742222,"carbohydrate_g":3.466667,"fat_g":6.85},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168462/nutrients","version":"92a5511163b62320","fdc_ids":[168462,171287,171411,17346